OL,3,AUK diesel price tops #2 a litre as G7
OL,4,Acountries agree to release 100 million
OL,5,Abarrels of oil
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe average price of diesel has risen
OL,8,Fabove #2 a litre in the UK for the
OL,9,Ffirst time, according to the RAC
OL,10,Fmotoring group, as G7 nations agreed to
OL,11,Frelease 100 million barrels of oil to
OL,12,Fhead off further increases.
OL,14,FDiesel has now hit an average of
OL,15,F200.01p a litre, the RAC said, and
OL,16,Fpetrol prices are also still rising,
OL,17,Freaching 174.71p a litre on average.
OL,19,FThe motoring group said price rises
OL,20,Fwere "showing no signs of slowing,
OL,21,Fheaping more misery onto motorists".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
