OL,3,AUK diesel price tops #2 a litre as G7
OL,4,Acountries agree to release 100 million
OL,5,Abarrels of oil
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe G7 group of advanced nations,
OL,8,Fincluding the US, said the move would
OL,9,Fstabilise supplies and shield
OL,10,Fhouseholds from further price spikes at
OL,11,Fa time of "unprecedented volatility in
OL,12,Foil markets".
